WEBVTT

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:05.730
Why do you laugh?

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:09.820
It's to keep it clean while I work.

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:13.740
I'm sorry, you just looked adorable
when you did that.

00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:15.700
Adorable?

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:18.790
I never taught you such frivolous words.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.790
Nori and Hiro taught me.

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:27.050
I see. You used to be more reserved,
but I see you've changed.

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:29.420
But if you don't like it...

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:32.260
Stay the way you are now.

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:35.970
You're not my pupil any longer.

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:41.930
This brings back memories. It's been
so long since you last patted my head.

00:00:43.270 --> 00:00:45.190
Do you feel like a child again?

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:48.570
Yes. Your hand is always so warm.

00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:53.450
Shirogane. Here you are.

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:55.240
Thank you.

00:00:55.410 --> 00:00:59.290
I must attend to something.
Return to your room when finished.

00:00:59.450 --> 00:01:01.950
Okay. I will put these away.

00:01:04.210 --> 00:01:09.050
-You traveled with him for a long time.
-Yes, I did.

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:12.050
Were you lovers?

00:01:12.220 --> 00:01:18.100
Oh no, he is more like
a big brother to me.

00:01:32.490 --> 00:01:35.450
Am I destined to lose my way?

00:01:35.610 --> 00:01:38.740
All I want is to have fun in my life

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:44.830
All I want is to be with those I love

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:51.090
Ready or not
Here I come

00:01:51.250 --> 00:01:54.050
I don't care anymore

00:01:54.220 --> 00:01:56.880
I just don't know anymore

00:01:57.050 --> 00:02:00.390
I wish everything would just disappear

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:03.520
There are days when I think like that

00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:06.060
But everything is precious to me

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:09.270
And so I fight on

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:12.780
Today was a tough day

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:15.860
I almost gave up hope

00:02:16.030 --> 00:02:22.080
But the truth is I don't want
to lose anything anymore

00:02:22.330 --> 00:02:25.370
I wish everything would just disappear

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:28.920
There are days when I think like that

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:31.540
But everything is precious to me

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:34.800
And so I must fight

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:53.690
#30 Pietà

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:00.530
Um, hey.

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:05.240
Never mind.

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:07.910
How many times are you going to do that?

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:13.000
You've recovered now, so go on and
shout at me like before.

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:17.840
Is that how you see me?

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:19.930
There, you finally smiled.

00:03:20.430 --> 00:03:25.260
You've been too mad at Éléonore to smile
since we got here.

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:31.650
Well, about her...

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:35.110
Don't worry. I won't ever forgive her.

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:37.150
No, I mean...

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:40.910
I don't trust how compliant she's being.

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:43.320
She'll let her true colors show.

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:46.830
And when she does...

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:51.500
I'll kill her. Mark my word.

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:54.000
Minghai...

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:56.500
How pained you look.

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:03.720
Wait, could Minghai also be...

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:05.930
If he is...

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:11.270
Hey, Guy's calling for me.

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:13.440
We'll talk again later.

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:19.860
If he is...

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:23.160
how could I ever win?

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:33.290
What do you want?

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:36.250
About Éléonore.

00:04:36.590 --> 00:04:42.260
Do you still plan to kill her,
even though you know she's innocent?

00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:47.390
Faceless spread ZONAPHA
throughout the whole world because of her.

00:04:47.560 --> 00:04:50.270
She should be held responsible for it.

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:53.690
I will kill her.

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:58.730
I see. I have no choice then.

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:00.480
As her guardian...

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:03.990
I challenge you to a duel.

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:06.990
Are you being serious?

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:10.830
You and Éléonore will leave here tomorrow.

00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:13.160
I must settle this before that.

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:15.670
Can't you wait until it's all over?

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:18.460
Come, I'm stooping to your level.

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:23.050
I will not let live
anybody who will hurt her.

00:05:25.180 --> 00:05:28.720
Promise me you won't hurt her if I win.

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:33.560
You idiot, is she worth doing this for?

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:35.810
She certainly is.

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:39.570
Look after Éléonore for me.

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:45.860
Her well-being comes before
all other things at all times for me.

00:05:47.070 --> 00:05:49.780
She's like my little sister.

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:51.200
Dammit.

00:05:53.870 --> 00:05:55.370
Your body...

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:58.210
I haven't long left.

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:00.630
The time has come.

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:03.880
Can't you stop the petrification?

00:06:04.220 --> 00:06:06.130
Not in this condition.

00:06:06.590 --> 00:06:10.100
My vitality has been weakening
this past year.

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:13.020
I feel that death is near.

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:15.850
Now, let's resume our duel.

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:18.850
I can't fight you. You're dying.

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:21.360
Then, do you surrender?

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:24.570
Are you saying I win?

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:30.490
Once I'm gone, do you promise
not to kill Éléonore?

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:34.750
I can't promise you that.

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:38.710
Then you must answer me this.

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:44.880
As a man, what are your feelings
towards Éléonore?

00:06:57.310 --> 00:06:59.520
It's written all over your face.

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:02.270
Shut up, you don't know anything about me.

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:04.690
I know you're an uncouth caveman.

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:10.570
Look what you've done to my shirt.
It's haute couture, you know.

00:07:10.820 --> 00:07:13.950
-But the duel...
-Forget it.

00:07:15.540 --> 00:07:20.960
You're going with Fou ahead of us
to guard the launch pad, right?

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:26.710
Don't worry. I won't do anything
to Éléonore until we get there.

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:28.970
We'll fight this out later.

00:07:29.180 --> 00:07:30.840
So you better not die.

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:33.850
Go on now.

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:38.480
I will sit here and read
until you leave tomorrow morning.

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:43.150
You heard me. I owe you a good punch.

00:07:43.310 --> 00:07:45.480
So inelegant, as always.

00:07:47.490 --> 00:07:49.450
Remember what I taught you?

00:07:49.650 --> 00:07:51.740
Say something more chic, like...

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:55.700
"Bon voyage, have a good journey."

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:08.920
Is that good, little Japanese boy?

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:12.260
My name is Masaru. Masaru Saiga.

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:14.800
I'm Sharon Montfort.

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:19.020
Before the world came to this,
I taught children your age.

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:21.520
-You were a teacher?
-Yes.

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:24.940
And you were the only one
that didn't contract ZONAPHA.

00:08:25.110 --> 00:08:29.400
I wonder why.
I thought there was no way to stop it.

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:35.030
It's strange, isn't it? But I think
it's thanks to a certain person.

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:41.040
The school bus I was on
was attacked by automata.

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:45.880
I almost died.

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:51.130
But a really strong person saved us.

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:53.630
He gave me some of his blood to drink.

00:08:53.930 --> 00:08:56.510
That's how I survived.

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:01.850
-What was he like?
-Tall and buff.

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:04.650
He did some Asian martial arts.

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:10.150
He had black hair and black eyes.
He might've been Japanese, too.

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:14.950
His name... Do you know his name?

00:09:15.160 --> 00:09:19.160
Well, it was a hard name to remember.

00:09:19.540 --> 00:09:25.620
The handsome man he was with called him
"Narmie" or "Narume" or something.

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:33.510
He's alive.

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:36.970
Narumi is alive.

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:39.930
Are you okay?

00:09:40.810 --> 00:09:43.680
I don't know how he survived.

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:47.730
But he's become a shirogane
and is traveling the world.

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:53.110
I'm glad.

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:56.320
I'm so glad.

00:09:56.490 --> 00:09:57.950
Hey, Masaru?

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:09.920
I heard there's a facility up north
for ZONAPHA patients.

00:10:10.090 --> 00:10:12.670
I hope you find that person there.

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:14.590
Yeah. Thanks for everything.

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:20.600
I heard later that the person who saved me
cried afterwards.

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:24.730
Saying, "Thank you for being saved."

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:29.690
So could you tell him for me
if you meet him?

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:34.940
That I hope he can be saved, too.

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:37.860
Narumi? Be saved?

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:40.160
I only met him for a minute.

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:46.210
But I sensed that he's the type
who burns himself out for others.

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:48.370
So please.

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:52.880
Yeah, I'll make sure I tell him.

00:11:00.890 --> 00:11:06.270
Sir Graziano, the humans are hiding
in yonder castle.

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:07.980
All right.

00:11:08.190 --> 00:11:10.560
All automata, forward, march!

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:16.440
I need not remind you.

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:20.700
But if you are killed
and the space shuttle destroyed,

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:22.830
all humankind will be lost.

00:11:23.870 --> 00:11:30.580
ZONAPHA will kill every last human
on the face of this earth in 11 days.

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:35.880
And we, who will survive it,
won't last long against the automata.

00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:41.140
But nobody will blame you
even if that happens.

00:11:42.090 --> 00:11:44.350
It's a reckless plan to begin with.

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:47.850
You got nerves of steel, old man.

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:52.690
Climb on in now. I'll be waiting for you
at the Bodny Cosmodrome.

00:11:52.860 --> 00:11:54.480
We're counting on you.

00:11:54.820 --> 00:11:55.860
Narumi.

00:11:56.570 --> 00:11:58.740
We wrote these letters for you.

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:00.570
Thanks.

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:03.410
I'll go beat those bad guys up.

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:06.910
And you'll all be able
to play outside again.

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:12.710
Cigarettes? Nice parting gift.

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:15.630
They're not exactly roses.

00:12:15.840 --> 00:12:19.920
Why don't you join our circus
when this is all over?

00:12:20.220 --> 00:12:23.890
Sorry, but the only thing I know how to do
is to kill.

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:26.470
Then how about as my husband?

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:28.770
Join us as family.

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:34.270
I like that. I'd be well entertained
with you throwing knives at me all day.

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:35.520
Later.

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:38.030
Mingxia.

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:45.120
You didn't fall.

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:51.210
Good. Protect Minghai for me.

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:58.590
I really loved Minghai.

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:03.340
What pretty silver hair.

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:07.760
I lose.

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:11.180
Be careful, Hiro, Nori.

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:12.430
Leave it to us.

00:13:12.730 --> 00:13:15.100
Let's get this show on the road.

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:22.400
Mr. Guy, I will be going now.

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:25.070
Wait for me at the cosmodrome.

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:38.170
As Shakespeare wrote...

00:13:39.800 --> 00:13:41.760
"I hold the world but as the world.

00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:47.890
A stage where every man
must play a part."

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:09.910
This man, Guy Christophe Rech,

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:13.830
has finally figured out
what part he must play.

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:18.460
What perfect timing.

00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:26.720
My ending should be nothing other
than a one-man show.

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:38.520
Find the humans and kill them!

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:47.700
Les Arts Martiaux.

00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:49.910
La Ronde de Destruction.

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:54.790
Where's the train with the shuttle
and the humans?

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:57.660
They've gone to paradise. Too bad.

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:01.750
But those tracks will lead us there.

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:05.300
We'll just kill you and catch up to it.

00:15:09.090 --> 00:15:11.640
Where's Mr. Guy?

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:13.930
He stayed behind.

00:15:15.020 --> 00:15:16.810
What do you mean?

00:15:17.020 --> 00:15:18.600
To stall the automata.

00:15:18.890 --> 00:15:22.900
So we and the train
can get as far away as possible.

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:26.150
No... All by himself?

00:15:26.490 --> 00:15:30.660
He knew his days were numbered,
and volunteered to do so.

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:35.410
That's the kind of man he is.

00:15:39.460 --> 00:15:41.380
Not bad.

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:45.880
But how much longer will you last
against 3,000 automata?

00:15:46.460 --> 00:15:50.010
3,000?
Why didn't you tell me that earlier?

00:15:52.390 --> 00:15:55.680
It's the end. My arm...

00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:57.470
I must ignite it now.

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:03.610
No, I must lure them in further.

00:16:04.230 --> 00:16:05.730
All of them.

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:13.620
I have no choice. The switch...

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:14.740
Guy!

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:21.920
-Masaru!
-What?

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:26.000
He's supposed to be in outer space
with Lord Faceless's brain.

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:27.880
Get on, handsome devil!

00:16:28.050 --> 00:16:31.590
I don't know why you're alone,
but let's get out of here.

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:33.300
I can't go.

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:38.100
The rest have all left on the train.
I'm stalling the enemy.

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:42.480
Protect Shirogane for me.

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:44.730
No...

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:48.280
I see you have Arlequin. Take it to her.

00:16:48.780 --> 00:16:50.530
I can't leave you here.

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:52.280
It's not that simple.

00:16:53.410 --> 00:16:58.540
All surviving humans are taking a stand
on the stage for our lives.

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:01.580
And this is my stage.

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:04.960
You must go and stand on yours.

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:08.460
You swore to protect Shirogane, remember?

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:10.920
Enough with the talking. Charge!

00:17:11.880 --> 00:17:14.260
-Mr. Guy!
-Go, Masaru.

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:21.850
I'm a good man.
So you'll see me again up in heaven.

00:17:23.230 --> 00:17:24.810
We will meet again!

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:33.700
Such a crybaby as usual.

00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:39.490
But you're the best audience
a circus could wish for.

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:45.040
Your eyes inspire the performers
to push harder.

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:52.920
No matter how heartbroken they may be,
your gaze makes them stand tall again.

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:57.680
You keep them on their feet
until the act is over.

00:17:58.850 --> 00:18:00.180
It's the same for me.

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:04.430
And for Narumi and Éléonore.

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:15.740
Narumi, do you know what I remembered
as I watched you leave?

00:18:20.030 --> 00:18:25.250
The wedding of some strangers
that I happened to witness.

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:29.170
The groom, waiting at the altar.

00:18:31.880 --> 00:18:34.590
The bride, walking down the aisle.

00:18:45.020 --> 00:18:46.310
Narumi.

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:52.070
You often asked me why I saved you.

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:56.820
It's because I accepted you.

00:18:58.030 --> 00:19:00.070
I was worried about Éléonore.

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:04.790
So I watched you two at Karuizawa,
ready to lend a hand.

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:12.170
And I realized that Éléonore
was learning to love you.

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:19.180
I kept you from leaving this world
and drew you into the same fate as mine.

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:23.350
Because you were the one
who would understand Éléonore.

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:27.180
The only man who could stay by her side.

00:19:28.440 --> 00:19:32.810
Just like the glorious Angelina and Shoji.

00:19:37.900 --> 00:19:43.870
That's why I chose this role for myself
on the stage that is this world.

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:47.330
This is the end for you, Guy!

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:06.560
Thank you, Olympia.

00:20:07.020 --> 00:20:09.770
It's almost time for us
to leave the stage.

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:14.020
Was that line inelegant?

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:18.530
What words would be fitting then?

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:28.160
Yes, that's it.

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:41.760
It's "I wish you happiness."

00:20:47.810 --> 00:20:48.970
What...?

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:54.100
Guy!

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:33.440
Olympia...

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:38.650
Your face...

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:46.450
I created it... from Maman's death mask...

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:51.870
Maman...

00:21:52.830 --> 00:21:54.460
I'll be with you soon.

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:59.960
This time, hold me.

00:22:01.210 --> 00:22:03.300
Hold me close...

00:22:20.520 --> 00:22:25.200
A past that can't become a memory
plays on repeat

00:22:25.360 --> 00:22:29.990
In my mind is a forgotten thing
that I still remember

00:22:30.160 --> 00:22:34.660
Questions remain unanswered
but I must go now

00:22:34.830 --> 00:22:39.580
I walk in the dark,
making a promise to my footprints

00:22:39.750 --> 00:22:44.420
So many similar beings
leading similar lives

00:22:44.590 --> 00:22:48.930
Was there a reason
for me to be born at all?

00:22:49.140 --> 00:22:53.640
The world lost all sound
but for the ticking of a clock

00:22:53.810 --> 00:22:58.730
A missing heart keeps shouting

00:22:58.900 --> 00:23:03.440
A meaningless life was shaking

00:23:03.610 --> 00:23:07.990
All because of your unique existence

00:23:08.150 --> 00:23:12.620
If the reason for the pain
is revealed someday

00:23:12.780 --> 00:23:17.370
If you find a home
for those tears someday

00:23:17.540 --> 00:23:22.590
You shall sleep
with the whole universe in your arms

00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:30.390
I know it still plays in your heart

00:23:30.550 --> 00:23:34.350
The melody that brought you here
